~ start

Guide: It's time to grow your first crop.
Guide: Harvest 5 Corn and bring it back to me.

=> END


~ progress

Guide: Keep going!
Guide: I need 5 Corn before we can continue rebuilding Harvestia.

=> END


~ turn_in

Guide: Excellent work!

Guide: You've grown your very first harvest.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: Farming is the heart of Harvestia.

Guide: But rebuilding this place will take more than crops.

Guide: Take this Axe.

do GameDialogueManager.action_give_axe()

Guide: My old friend, the Forest Ranger, has been guarding the bridge for years.

Guide: Go and speak with him.
Guide: He'll let you into the forest.

=> END


~ completed

Guide: The Forest Ranger is waiting for you.

=> END